400 levels selected from Sasquatch I–XII. Original puzzle titles and playable
layouts are retained. Rows are padded for rectangular rendering; outside
padding is marked non-playable. A complete, unchanged copy of the source
collection and its notes/solutions is in collections/Skinner.sok.
