Reference app: 推箱子大全-解谜5000个有趣的关卡, App Store ID 1057916274.
Its public listing describes crowded warehouses, limited passages and pushing
order, but does not disclose a definitive highest-two-tier puzzle inventory
or difficulty thresholds. This game's Expert/Master tiers are our curated
classic multi-crate interpretation, not a reproduction or a claim of exact
difficulty equivalence to that app. No reference-app code, artwork or levels
were extracted.
